/Title (The project uses a modular AI architecture. Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite is used for Question Answering, Quiz Generation, Summarization, and Personalized Learning Path generation. LaMini-Flan-T5-783M is used locally for Concept Explanation. This allocation separates the general-purpose generative tasks from the local concept-explanation module.)
